  "name": "SAIMOS - Biological and Flow Cytometry data collected from CTD stations in South Australia, in April 2015",
  "citation": "(2015-11-24T10:00:00), SAIMOS - Biological and Flow Cytometry data collected from CTD stations in South Australia, in April 2015, Integrated Marine Observing System (IMOS), https://catalogue-imos.aodn.org.au:443/geonetwork/srv/api/records/528f280c-b151-45c4-9526-e0746510a617.",
  "creator": [
    {
